{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47625","headline":"化江南简寂观道士侯用晦磨劒 · 吕岩","name":"化江南简寂观道士侯用晦磨劒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲整锋鋩取惮劳，凌晨开匣玉龙嗥。\n手中气概冰三尺，石上精神虵一条。\n奸血默随流水尽，凶豪今逐渍痕消。\n削平浮世不平事，与尔相将上九霄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}